{"unit_id":"Relethe__dsh-brief-session-title#feature-1","repo":"Relethe/dsh-brief-session-title","commit":"a0fa34a043af7a62eb753f33b67e44e28d8cec6c","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-brief-session-title 的功能「首条消息生成标题」：新会话自动选择第一条人类消息作为标题输入，并调用 DSH 标题模型服务生成会话名。触发方式为 first-prompt 标题提供方注册。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:165-192"]}
