{"unit_id":"Relethe__dsh-brief-session-title#feature-4","repo":"Relethe/dsh-brief-session-title","commit":"a0fa34a043af7a62eb753f33b67e44e28d8cec6c","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-brief-session-title 的功能「模型输出整理」：从响应文本取第一个非空行，去掉包围整行的星号强调并归一化标题；工具调用、非正常结束和空标题会被拒绝。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:86-126"]}
